        "# **PROJECT INTRODUCTION : AGRICULTURAL AND MARKET ANALYSIS OF RICE PRICING**\n",
        "\n",
        "### **OVERVIEW :**\n",
        "This project provides a comprehensive end-to-end data analysis analyzing global rice market dynamics. Utilizing a dataset containing historical records of rice types, regions, pricing, environmental metrics, and trade details, this analysis is structured as follows:\n",
        "\n",
        "**1. Data Loading & Overview:** Importing and evaluating raw, messy dataset structures.\n",
        "\n",
        "**2. Data Pre-Processing:** Cleaning data by resolving structural inconsistencies, handling missing values, converting data types, removing duplicates, and standardizing text features.\n",
        "\n",
        "**3. Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA):** Extracting key statistical insights regarding market demand, crop supply, local climates, and financial margins.\n",
        "\n",
        "**4. Data Visualization:** Creating a rich suite of 10 pictorial visualizations to communicate regional behaviors, environmental correlations, and price trajectories over time.\n",
        "\n",
        "### **KEY OBJECTIVES :**\n",
        "To identify supply-demand disparities, understand how weather factors (rainfall and temperature) correlate with pricing, and provide stakeholders with actionable, data-driven market insights."
